<title>USA: Flagstar reaches tentative debt restructing.</title>
<headline>Flagstar reaches tentative debt restructing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flagstar Companies Inc announced on Monday night that it had reached a tentative financial restructuring plan with an ad hoc committee representing holders of its senior subordinated debt.</p>
<p>The company also stated it would not make a $7.1 million interest payment due March 15 on its 11.375 percent senior subordinated debentures of '03. It will, however, make a $14.5 million interest payment on its 10.75 percent senior notes of '01 due on the same day.</p>
</text>
